<article class="env-lemma" id="05VW">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/05VW">Lemma <span data-tag="05VW">67.31.3</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  \xymatrix{ X' \ar[d]_{f'} \ar[r]_{g'} &  X \ar[d]^ f \\  Y' \ar[r]^ g &  Y }  \]
</div>
  <p> be a cartesian diagram of algebraic spaces over $S$. Let $x' \in |X'|$ with image $x \in |X|$. Let $\mathcal{F}$ be a quasi-coherent sheaf on $X$ and denote $\mathcal{F}' = (g')^*\mathcal{F}$. </p>
  <p><ol>
  <li><p>
If $\mathcal{F}$ is flat at $x$ over $Y$ then $\mathcal{F}'$ is flat at $x'$ over $Y'$. 
</p>
</li><li><p>
If $g$ is flat at $f'(x')$ and $\mathcal{F}'$ is flat at $x'$ over $Y'$, then $\mathcal{F}$ is flat at $x$ over $Y$. 
</p>
</li>
</ol></p>
  <p> In particular, if $\mathcal{F}$ is flat over $Y$, then $\mathcal{F}'$ is flat over $Y'$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Choose a scheme $V$ and a surjective étale morphism $V \to Y$. Choose a scheme $U$ and a surjective étale morphism $U \to V \times _ Y X$. Choose a scheme $V'$ and a surjective étale morphism $V' \to V \times _ Y Y'$. Then $U' = V' \times _ V U$ is a scheme endowed with a surjective étale morphism $U' = V' \times _ V U \to Y' \times _ Y X = X'$. Pick $u' \in U'$ mapping to $x' \in |X'|$. Then we can check flatness of $\mathcal{F}'$ at $x'$ over $Y'$ in terms of flatness of $\mathcal{F}'|_{U'}$ at $u'$ over $V'$. Hence the lemma follows from More on Morphisms, Lemma <a href="/tag/047C" data-tag="047C">37.15.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>